\newlabel{fig:det}{{10}{8}{Top: knowledge vs control error (log scale); knowledge peaks at \ang {1.03} during acquisition, then holds \ang {0.0045} RMS. Bottom: the gyro-bias estimate; the initial \(\sim \)\SI {100}{\degree \per \hour } spike is the first fixes over-correcting during acquisition, converging to \SI {0.25}{\degree \per \hour }}{figure.caption.11}{}}
